<view class="page"><view class="card row"><view class="title">{{studentName||'课时权益'}}</view><picker wx:if="{{students.length>1}}" range="{{students}}" range-key="name" value="{{studentIndex}}" bindchange="chooseStudent"><view class="switch">切换孩子 ▾</view></picker></view><view wx:if="{{rows.length}}" class="card"><view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id" class="item"><view class="title">{{item.courseName}}</view><view class="numbers"><text>付费剩余 {{item.paidRemaining}}</text><text>赠送剩余 {{item.bonusRemaining}}</text></view><view class="muted">合计剩余 {{item.totalRemaining}} 节 · 有效期至 {{item.expiresOn||'长期有效'}}</view></view></view><view wx:else class="card muted">暂无已开通课时。续费请与工作室线下沟通。</view></view>